Package: rscx
Title: SCX File Format for Single-Cell RNA-seq
Version: 0.8.5
Authors@R:
    person("Arc Institute", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "scx@arcinstitute.org")
Description: R bindings for the SCX (Sparse Cell eXpression) binary file
    format. Provides fast reading, writing, and querying of single-cell
    RNA-seq data with native Seurat v5 and SingleCellExperiment interop.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.78)
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: Matrix, methods
Suggests:
    Seurat (>= 5.0.0),
    SeuratObject (>= 5.0.0),
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Config/rextendr/version: 0.3.1
